aggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/image-27.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-9%, 13%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image15103749\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/image-28.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-5%, 12%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"250\" dom2webgl=\"image15117402\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/image-29.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-10%, -10%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-200\" dom2webgl=\"image15138832\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/image-31.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(12%, -13%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"20\" dom2webgl=\"image15152695\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Product-Snapshot-7-1.jpg\"/></div></div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nThe Challenge \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nWe were approached by Allies of Skin to create a series of CGI visuals to promote two new products in their skincare range. The visuals were to be used predominantly in their social media campaign, but also further afield on their website and printed materials.<br/>\n<br/>\nThe outcome is a collection of two types of visuals: abstract renders that aim to promote the ‘allies’ or benefits of the products; and secondly, realistic product renders to showcase the brand and product in more detail.<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image16216aaa8336946f0\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/mist03.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image16246aaa83369b03a\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/shot-03-edit-1.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nMolecular treatment mist\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nSilver, Silk Amino Acids, and Ergothioneine that work through the day to refine the appearance of pores and counteract the effects of jetlag and fatigue.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/aos-mist.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1627\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image15186aaa83369c101\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/mist-1-1920x1080.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-2\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image15206aaa8336a1a7e\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/mist-2.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Lactobacillus-1200x1200_Clean-1.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1526\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-2\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image15216aaa8336a8017\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/mist-4.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/T3-1200x1200-1.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1527\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image15296aaa8336aa8b5\" src=\"/media/634333fd6837.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\